category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Generic Security Services Application Programming Interface Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Libgssglue provides a GSS-API library, but does not implement any
mechanisms itself; instead it calls routines in other libraries,
depending on the mechanism and system configuration."
